          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "खरेदी करणे — kharedī karṇe — \"to go shopping; to purchase\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सणासाठी आम्ही खूप खरेदी केली. saṇāsāṭhī āmhī khūp kharedī kelī. We did a lot of shopping for the festival."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने खरेदी केली, tyāne kharedī kelī."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "खरेदी is feminine, so the past is खरेदी केली."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "खरेदी करणे (kharedī karṇe) joins खरेदी, \"buying\", a loan usually traced to Persian xarīdī, to the light verb करणे, \"to do\"."
            }
          ]
        },
